 "remarks": "This 8th Floor condo at Fountain Terrace is bright and sunny, offering a wonderful view of the city and the LI Sound. This popular, pet-friendly building conveniently situated high atop Strawberry Hill, offers convenience to all that Downtown has to offer... dining, shopping, entertainment, schools, etc. This spacious 2-Bedroom and 1 bath condo provides plenty of living space plus a generous sunny balcony. Reserved/ off-street parking. Amenities include a upgraded elevators, a swimming pool, 24-security/ gate house, a play ground area, an in-house fitness center and storage room. HOA covers so much - heat, sewer & water, trash removal, meticulous year-round grounds maintenance & snow removal, basic cable tv/internet, cooking gas. All the owner pays for is the electric! Visit today...",
